P-013 PATCH — Closed-Loop Learning + Anti-Bloat Knowledge Governance Layer

PURPOSE

Introduce a self-improving but bounded learning system across JARVIS + AYRE that:

learns techniques automatically

stores reusable knowledge

prevents memory bloat

enforces compression-first evolution

maintains strict separation between discovery, governance, and canonical memory



---

1. SYSTEM OVERVIEW

Core Principle

> Learning is decoupled from commitment.



AYRE (discover) → JARVIS (govern) → VALIDATION → MEMORY COMMIT

No direct ingestion into canonical memory is permitted.


---

